<title>USA: Key IMM currency future begin lower.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency future begin lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 14 - Key IMM currency futures began lower, in tune with overnight losses versus the dollar. Sept marks hit another new contract low overnight at $0.5590. Only June Atlanta Fed index due today, at 0900 CDT/1400 GMT.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
